  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0: Join Operations - Added Join() and LeftJoin() support for multi-table queries with type-safe key selectors and automatic column aliasing. New IJoinQueryBuilder and IJoinProjectionQueryBuilder interfaces. Support for WHERE, ORDER BY, LIMIT, COUNT on joined results. MemberInitExpression and NewExpression parsing in Select projections. v1.5.1: Having() clause for filtering grouped results with aggregate predicates (Count, Sum, Average, Min, Max). Fixed JsonElement handling in CountAsync and nullability warnings. 12 new unit tests + 9 integration tests. Full backward compatibility.",
